 class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-gray-900\">Licence en Chimie</h3>\n                            \n                            <span class=\"text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-green-100 text-green-700\">Ouverte</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <!-- <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mt-2\" th:if=\"${option.details != null}\"\n                            th:text=\"${option.details}\">Détails de l'option</p> -->\n                        <a href=\"/programmes/view-option/11840/FDS-Licence%20en%20Chimie%20(null)\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">Voir les programmes</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border rounded-lg p-4 hover:shadow-md transition\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-gray-900\">Master en Géosciences</h3>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-100 text-red-700\">Fermée</span>\n                            \n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1\">Master en Géosciences de la Faculté Des Sciences (FDS) de l’Université d’État d’Haïti (UEH)</p>\n                        <!-- <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mt-2\" th:if=\"${option.details != null}\"\n                            th:text=\"${option.details}\">Détails de l'option</p> -->\n                        <a href=\"/programmes/view-option/156527/FDS-Master%20en%20G%C3%A9osciences%20(Master%20en%20G%C3%A9osciences%20de%20la%20Facult%C3%A9%20Des%20Sciences%20(FDS)%20de%20l%E2%80%99Universit%C3%A9%20d%E2%80%99%C3%89tat%20d%E2%80%99Ha%C3%AFti%20(UEH))\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">Voir les programmes</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n\n\n\n        